ic pumps, and industrial blowers, as well as operates a network of aviation maintenance, repair, and overhaul facilities. AMETEK, Inc. was incorporated in 1930 and is headquartered in Berwyn, Pennsylvania.","employees":22500,"website":"https://www.ametek.com","country":"United States","city":"Berwyn","officers":[{"name":"Mr. David A. Zapico","title":"Chairman of the Board & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. Dalip Mohan Puri","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Ronald J. Oscher","title":"Chief Administrative Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":20.36,"tpe":27.47,"ps":3.42,"pfcf":30.39,"peg":1.56,"pb":6.084,"rev_growth":0.097,"eps_growth":0.13,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1265,"eps_growth_next":0.1335,"div_yield":0.0115,"roe":0.204,"roa":0.07231,"de":70.14,"gross_margin":0.3678,"op_margin":0.1746,"profit_margin":0.1184,"current_ratio":1.328},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":25.21,"sector":20.36,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":35.09,"sector":27.47,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":6.998,"sector":3.42,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":36.88,"sector":30.39,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":2.73,"sector":1.56,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":4.887,"sector":6.084,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":20.52,"sector":70.14,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.15,"sector":0.097,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0.142,"sector":0.13,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.1275,"sector":0.1265,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"eps_growth_next","label":"EPS growth (next year, est.)","v":0.1367,"sector":0.1335,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"gross_margin","label":"Gross margin","v":0.3691,"sector":0.3678,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"op_margin","label":"Operating margin","v":0.2618,"sector":0.1746,"verdict":"St